GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE VicProvisionEntry
`entry of the provision index for an identifier` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN e YIELD e's `identifier` EQUALS identifier) `provision index`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN e FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST e

GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`identifier is one the text prints` MEANS elem identifier `identifiers down to paragraph level`
